            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0px 0px 5px 70px; ">Sub:  Document Verification call letter for Selection to the post of Junior Manager (Discipline)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0px 0px 5px 70px; ">
                    Ref.:   a) HCL’s Notification No. Estt./1/2020/2023-24 dated 25/06/2024 and your online application against the said notification for the above referred post.
                    </p><br style="display: none;">
                    <p style="padding: 0px 0px 5px 35px; "> b) Your Written Test Roll Number.: <b>@Html.DisplayFor(model => model.strApplicationNo, null, new { @class = "form-control" })</b></p>
                </td>

            </tr>
            <tr><td style="padding-bottom: 20px;">Dear Sir / Madam,</td></tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; ">
                    <p>With reference to the above on the captioned subject, you are requested to appear for Document Verification, as per the schedule given below.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
