                                </td>
                                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 15px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; width: 100%; display: block; padding: 0; padding-left: 50px; ">
                                    <b valign="top" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 5px;">(c)	Venue</b> <p style="display: inline-block; padding: 0px 0px 5px 78px;">
                                        : Corporate office, Hindustan Copper Limited,  <br style="display: block;">
                                        Tamra Bhawan,1, Ashutosh Chowdhury Avenue, Kolkata - 700 019 <br style="display: block;">
                                        [Landmark: Opp. Ice Skating Rink, Ballygunge] <br style="display: block;">
                                    </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
