                    </table>
                </td>

            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 10px; ">
                    <p>
                        <b>(2)</b> Your candidature for the post is subject to production of documents in respect of eligibility criteria regarding educational qualification, age, Experience, Caste Certificate (as applicable), etc.
                    </p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 10px; ">
                    <p><b>(3)</b> Please come prepared with the Original documents in respect of eligibility criteria along with number of photocopies sets which are required for verification. In case of failure to present any of the said documents, your candidature for the post shall be liable to be cancelled. Please note that no photocopying support shall be available at the venue of Personal Interview.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 35px; ">
                    <p>
                        <b>(a)</b> a. Two (02) sets of self-attested photocopies of the ORIGINAL documents arranged / sequenced in order given below.
                    </p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(i)</b> Declaration Form-I of the Candidate (1 Original + 2 Photocopy: With each Form-I enclose following document in order given below)i.	Declaration Form-I of the Candidate (Original and enclose following documents photocopy in order given below)
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
