                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(iii)</b> Declaration Form-II for SC / ST / OBC / EWS (if applicable)</p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(iv)</b> Caste Certificate: SC / ST / OBC (Non-Creamy Layer) in the Government of India format </p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(v)</b> EWS Certificate valid for 2024-25 (if applicable)</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(vi)</b> Disability Certificate (if applicable) duly issued by an authority as prescribed in the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Rules – 2017, failing which their candidature as PwBD will not be considered.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
