                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(viii)</b> 12th Class Certificate / Marksheet, as applicable</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(ix)</b> Diploma Mark Sheet (Semester-wise / Consolidated) and Certificate, as applicable</p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(x)</b> Graduation Mark Sheet (Semester-wise / Consolidated) and Certificate, as applicable</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(xi)</b> Certificate of Competency (Statutory Qualification) </p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px; ">
                    <p><b>(xii)</b>	Post-Graduation Mark Sheet (Semester-wise / Consolidated) and Certificate, as applicable </p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px;">
                    <p><b>(xiii)</b> Professional / Other qualification – Certificates & Mark Sheet (as applicable) </p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px;">
                    <p><b>(xiv)</b>	No Objection Certificate from Present Employer, if employed in ‘Central / State Government’, ‘Central / State PSEs’, ‘Autonomous organizations of Government of India (as applicable)’. </p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px;">
                    <p><b>(xv)</b> Experience Certificate/s for establishing the Post Qualification Years of Experience as per Para [3(A)] of the notification along with the Pay Slip (for 3 months), last FY Form-16 and Banks statement (for 3 months) as documentary evidence to be submitted. </p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 50px;">
                    <p><b>(xvi)</b>	Photo Identification Card (Voters / Driving License / PAN / Aadhar / Passport)</p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 35px;">
                    <p><b>(b)</b>	Two (02) sets of photocopies of the above listed documents [arranged in given order along with your passport-size photographs 2 (two) nos.] to be made available during the verification.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 35px; ">
                    <p><b>(c)</b>	Original Certificate / Marksheet and other documents establishing the suitability for the post shall be made available by the candidate for verifying with the photocopy sets submitted during the process.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>



            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 10px; ">
                    <p><b>(4)</b>	Two (2) copies of enclosed Form-III for claiming TA along with copy of travel tickets and filled ‘Bank Mandate Form’.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 10px; ">
                    <p> <b>(5)</b>&nbsp;<b style=" padding: 0 0 0 10px;">(a)</b> Candidates called for document verification and successfully completed shall only be reimbursed to and fro fare by shortest route as per rules from the address of correspondence in India to the place of interview on submission of proof of journey (Ticket and Boarding Pass for Air travel and of Rail Ticket) as per rules subject to actuals whichever is lower, limited to the details as under.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>


            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border:0; padding: 0 80px;">
                    <table style="width: 100%; padding: 10px 0;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                        <tbody>


                            <tr>
                                <th style="border: 1px solid #000;text-align: center; padding: 3px; ">SN</th>
                                <th style="border: 1px solid #000;text-align: center; padding: 3px; ">Post and Grade</th>
                                <th style="border: 1px solid #000;text-align: center; padding: 3px; ">Eligible for</th>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000;text-align: center; padding: 3px; ">1</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 3px;">Junior Manager (E0 Grade) </td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center; padding: 3px;">Rail AC III Tier / ACC</td>
                            </tr>

                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </td>

            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
                    <p><b></b> Bus fare for road journey from / to a place not connected by Rail shall be admissible, subject to production of proof of journey.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
                    <p><b>(b)</b>  The reimbursement towards to and fro journey shall be entertained only if the candidate has successfully completed document verification. Please ensure that all documents detailed in Para (3) above are submitted.  </p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
                    <p><b>(c)</b>  No reimbursement of travelling expenses shall be made if a candidate is provisionally allowed, for any reason whatsoever.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
                    <p><b>(d)</b>  The settlement of reimbursement of travelling expenses will be made by bank transfer, accordingly candidate is requested to submit bank account details in the prescribed bank ‘MANDATE FORM’ (enclosed) along with photo copy of the cheque / bank passbook.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 13px; ">
                    <p><b>(6)</b>  It is to be noted that Document Verification may last till late evening, therefore, candidates are advised to plan their return journey accordingly.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 13px;  ">
                    <p><b>(7)</b>  In case of variation in name / surname / name spelling mentioned in the application with that in the respective certificates pertaining to Qualification / Caste, etc., the applicant shall be required to submit an affidavit sworn-in before a First-Class Judicial Magistrate / appropriate authority to this effect along with the respective documents at the time of interview failing which the candidature shall liable to be cancelled.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 13px;  ">
                    <p><b>(8)</b>  Please present a copy of this letter at the time of Document Verification.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 13px;  ">
                    <p><b>(9)</b>  Please note that:</p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align:left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px;  ">
                    <p><b>(a) MERE INVITATION TO ATTEND THE  DOCUMENT VERIFICATION PROCESS SHALL NOT CONFER ANY LEGAL RIGHT / CLAIM FOR EMPLOYMENT IN HINDUSTAN COPPER LIMITED.</b> </p>

                </td>
            </tr>


            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
                    <p><b>(b)</b> Your attention is drawn to Para [12(iv)] and Para [12(v)] of the HCL notification dated 25/06/2024 which are reproduced below for ready reference.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0px 45px; margin: 0;">
                    <ul>
                        <li>i.	Para [12(vi)]. Since all the applications will be screened based on the data furnished in the online application and without any documentary evidence / proof, the candidate should ensure that they meet all the prescribed eligibility criteria and other conditions as mentioned in this advertisement. </li>
                    </ul>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0px 45px; margin: 0;">
                    <ul>
                        <li>ii.	Para [12(vii)]. Candidates should note that the details provided by them in their application form are taken on their face value and the onus of proving the correctness and authenticity of the same as and when required lies with the applicant.</li>
                    </ul>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0px 45px; margin: 0;">
                    <ul>
                        <li>iii.	You are therefore advised to, in your own interest to check, confirm and ensure that you meet the prescribed eligibility criteria for the post applied by you as detailed in the advertisement before presenting yourself for the interview. You must also ensure that all requisite documents and copies thereof as detailed above are made available for submission and verification prior to the interview. Please note that failure on either of these counts shall render you ineligible to attend the interview and no communication in this regard shall be entertained by the Company.</li>
                    </ul>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
